min="0" max="10080" step="1" aria-describedby=":r:-notice-hint" value="120"><p id=":r:-notice-hint" class="text-xs text-slate-500">How far ahead a parent must book.</p></div><div class="space-y-1"><label class="text-sm font-medium leading-none peer-disabled:cursor-not-allowed peer-disabled:opacity-70" for=":r:-hold">Hold (minutes)</label><input type="number" class="flex h-9 w-full rounded-md border border-input bg-transparent px-3 py-1 text-base shadow-sm transition-colors file:border-0 file:bg-transparent file:text-sm file:font-medium file:text-foreground placeholder:text-muted-foreground focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:ring-ring disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 md:text-sm" id=":r:-hold" inputmode="numeric" min="1" max="60" step="1" aria-describedby=":r:-hold-hint" value="5"><p id=":r:-hold-hint" class="text-xs text-slate-500">How long a picked time is kept for her while she confirms.</p></div><div class="space-y-1"><label class="text-sm font-medium leading-none peer-disabled:cursor-not-allowed peer-disabled:opacity-70" for=":r:-caller">Caller number shown in emails</label><input type="tel" class="flex h-9 w-full rounded-md border border-input bg-transparent px-3 py-1 text-base shadow-sm transition-colors file:border-0 file:bg-transparent file:text-sm file:font-medium file:text-foreground placeholder:text-muted-foreground focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:ring-ring disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 md:text-sm" id=":r:-caller" inputmode="tel" autocomplete="off" maxlength="40" aria-describedby=":r:-caller-hint" value=""><p id=":r:-caller-hint" class="text-xs text-slate-500">In the +44 form, e.g. +44 20 7946 0000. Leave empty to leave the line out.</p></div><div class="sm:col-span-2"><button type="submit" class="rounded-md border border-violet-200 bg-violet-50 px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-violet-700 hover:bg-violet-100 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 aria-disabled:cursor-not-allowed aria-disabled:opacity-50" aria-disabled="false">Save settings</button></div></form><p role="status" class="text-sm text-slate-600"></p></div></div></section><section aria-labelledby=":r:"><div class="rounded-xl border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow"><div class="space-y-4 p-4 sm:p-5"><h2 id=":r:" tabindex="-1" class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-900 focus:outline-none">Blocks (London time)</h2><p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Times you can't take calls. A booked call under a block stays booked and is flagged on the Calls tab.</p><form novalidate="" class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2"><div class="space-y-1"><label class="text-sm font-medium leading-none peer-disabled:cursor-not-allowed peer-disabled:opacity-70" for=":r:-fd">From date</label><input type="date" class="flex h-9 w-full rounded-md border border-input bg-transparent px-3 py-1 text-base shadow-sm transition-colors file:border-0 file:bg-transparent file:text-sm file:font-medium file:text-foreground placeholder:text-muted-foreground focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:ring-ring disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 md:text-sm" id=":r:-fd" aria-required="true" value="2027-02-04"></div><div class="space-y-1"><label class="text-sm font-medium leading-none peer-disabled:cursor-not-allowed peer-disabled:opacity-70" for=":r:-ft">From time</label><input type="time" class="flex h-9 w-full rounded-md border border-input bg-transparent px-3 py-1 text-base shadow-sm transition-colors file:border-0 file:bg-transparent file:text-sm file:font-medium file:text-foreground placeholder:text-muted-foreground focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:ring-ring disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 md:text-sm" id=":r:-ft" aria-required="true" step="60" value=""></div><div class="space-y-1"><label class="text-sm font-medium leading-none peer-disabled:cursor-not-allowed peer-disabled:opacity-70" for=":r:-td">To date</label><input typ