></form><p role="status" class="text-sm text-slate-600"></p><ul aria-label="Blocks ahead" class="divide-y divide-slate-100 rounded-md border border-slate-200"><li class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 px-3 py-2"><p class="min-w-0 break-words text-sm text-slate-700">Fri 5 Feb, 09:00 – 11:00 (London time) · dentist</p><button type="button" class="rounded-md border border-slate-200 bg-white px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 aria-disabled:cursor-not-allowed aria-disabled:opacity-50" aria-label="Remove block: Fri 5 Feb, 09:00 – 11:00 (London time), dentist" aria-disabled="false">Remove</button></li><li class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 px-3 py-2"><p class="min-w-0 break-words text-sm text-slate-700">Mon 15 Feb, 09:00 – Fri 19 Feb, 18:00 (London time) · holiday</p><button type="button" class="rounded-md border border-slate-200 bg-white px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 aria-disabled:cursor-not-allowed aria-disabled:opacity-50" aria-label="Remove block: Mon 15 Feb, 09:00 – Fri 19 Feb, 18:00 (London time), holiday" aria-disabled="false">Remove</button></li></ul></div></div></section></div><section aria-labelledby=":r:"><div class="rounded-xl border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow"><div class="space-y-3 p-4 sm:p-5"><h2 id=":r:" class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">Weekly hours (London time)</h2><p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Several ranges a day are fine; ranges may touch but not overlap.</p><form novalidate="" class="space-y-3"><div class="grid gap-x-6 md:grid-cols-2"><fieldset class="space-y-2 border-t border-slate-100 py-3 first:border-t-0"><legend class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900">Monday</legend><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600"><span aria-hidden="true">From</span><input type="time" class="flex h-9 rounded-md bo