 text-gray-800">Test</span></span><p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Advanced · Signed up Mon 1 Feb, 10:00 (London time)</p><span class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-3 gap-y-1 text-xs"><a class="font-medium text-violet-700 hover:underline focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-violet-500 rounded-sm" href="/admin/viewer/b0400000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001">Profile</a><a class="font-medium text-violet-700 hover:underline focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-violet-500 rounded-sm" href="/admin/users?openUser=b0400000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001">Account</a><a class="font-medium text-violet-700 hover:underline focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-violet-500 rounded-sm" href="/admin/users/b0400000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/subscription">Money</a><a class="font-medium text-violet-700 hover:underline focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-violet-500 rounded-sm" href="/admin/positions?openPosition=d0400000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001">Position</a></span></div><div class="min-h-0 flex-1 overflow-y-auto space-y-5 px-4 pb-24 pt-4"><p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Every time on this page is London time.</p><section aria-labelledby=":r:" class="space-y-2"><h3 id=":r:" class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-500">Contact</h3><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-2 text-sm"><a href="tel:+447700900111" aria-label="Call Ava Overdue on +44 (0) 7700 900 111" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md border border-violet-200 bg-violet-50 px-2.5 py-1 text-sm font-medium text-violet-700 hover:bg-violet-100 focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-violet-500"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-phone h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13.832 16.568a1 1 0 0 0 1.213-.3